# Excluded from deploy: GenAi metadata uses org-specific schema (versionIdentifier, etc.)
# Configure these in the org via Setup / Prompt Builder / Agent Builder if needed.
force-app/main/default/genAiPromptTemplates/
force-app/main/default/genAiFunctions/

# Custom Metadata RECORDS are org-specific (Claude Slack user id, auto-analyze flags,
# named credential names, project labels, etc.). Deploying/packaging them overwrites
# client sandbox configuration. Keep type/field defs in objects/; configure Default
# records once per org in Setup.
force-app/main/default/customMetadata/

# Named Credentials / secrets — do NOT package.
# Subscriber orgs create Slack_Webhook manually after install (Incoming Webhook URL).
# Packaging legacy NC without NamedCredentialType fails install on modern API versions.
# Repo keeps namedCredentials/Slack_Webhook as a source-deploy template only.
force-app/main/default/namedCredentials/
force-app/main/default/externalCredentials/

# Credential notes kept in docs/PACKAGING-GUIDE.md post-install checklist.

**/jsconfig.json
**/.eslintrc.json
